# Local configuration of the web app. Copy it to .env in this folder; .env is never committed.

# The address of the api: where the pages send their requests. Vite writes it into the pages when they are built,
# so a build made with one address talks to that server and no other.
# The address the pages themselves are opened at must be on the api's list of web pages (WEB_ORIGINS in
# apps/api/.env), or the api refuses every request they send.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:11210
